            "detailed_description": "<strong>The Mirage: Illusion of wish</strong> is a game to fight the enemies in order to make a wish.<br><br><br>There is a man who wants to save a daughter who is dying from an incurable disease.<br>Then one day an unknown person appeared and talked.<br>When you arrive at the end of the world he has created, you can make a wish.<br><br>What is the ending of this story in a strange world?<br><br><br><strong>The Mirage: Illusion of wish</strong> is a third-person shooter.<br>  - You can use 6 kinds of <strong>Gun mode</strong>.<br>  - You can buy items in the <strong>Shop</strong> to use in battle.<br>  - You can Upgrade your gun mode by using the <strong>Upgrade stone</strong>.<br>  - You can learn Abilities by using <strong>HP</strong> or <strong>Black crystals</strong>.<br>  - Use the <strong>Portal</strong> to quickly move to a battle area.<br>  - You can reach a <strong>Real ending</strong> by collecting all the hidden special items.<br><br><br>Currently, this game is <strong>Early Access</strong> state that is constantly updated.<br>Please read the <strong>Early Access Notes</strong> for future plans.",
